{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"偏屈t-结构"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"偏屈 t-结构"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>偏屈 t-结构是"},{"Local":{"url":"可构造层","text":"可构造"}},{"Plain":"复形范畴 $D_c^b(X)$ 上的 "},{"Local":{"url":"t-结构","text":"t-结构"}},{"Plain":",</p>\n<p>$$\r\n{^p D_c ^{\\leq 0}} (X) = \\{F \\in D_c^b(X) \\mid \\forall j \\in\\mathbb{Z}, \\dim \\operatorname{supp} H^j(F)\\leq j\\},\r\n$$</p>\n<p>$$\r\n{^p D_c ^{\\geq 0}} (X) = \\{F \\in D_c^b(X) \\mid \\forall j \\in\\mathbb{Z},\\dim \\operatorname{supp} H^j(\\mathbb D F)\\leq - j\\}.\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}